{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 27, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.1."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.3.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 28, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.1."], "text": "Develop strategies and regulations to implement the Comprehensive Plan goals, objectives, and policies. In particular, the City’s Zoning Code should be analyzed and amended as necessary to be consistent with and promote the Comprehensive Plan goals, objectives, and policies.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 29, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.2."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.3.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 30, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.2."], "text": "The Planning Department shall coordinate implementation of the Comprehensive Plan goals, objectives, and policies with other City Departments.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 31, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.3."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.3.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 32, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.3."], "text": "Designate a primary Development Review Official (DRO) charged with overseeing amendments to the Comprehensive Plan.

", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.3."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.3.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 32, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.3."], "text": "Designate a primary Development Review Official (DRO) charged with overseeing amendments to the Comprehensive Plan. The DRO shall possess the requisite comprehensive planning knowledge, experience, and skills to fairly and effectively amend the Comprehensive Plan.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 33, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.4."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.3.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 34, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.4."], "text": "Budget and allocate adequate funding for implementation of the Comprehensive Plan. Emphasis shall be placed on funding projects in the Capital Improvements Element and Programs, with particular emphasis on those that are required in order to maintain or attain and exceed adopted Levels of Service (LOS).", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 35, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4."], "text": "Objective ADM-1.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 36, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4."], "text": "Monitor, evaluate and appraise in order to gauge the Comprehensive Plan successes and failures, and develop future recommendations.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 37, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.1."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.4.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 38, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.1.

", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.1."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.4.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 38, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.1."], "text": "Develop procedures for the regular monitoring, evaluation, and appraisal of the Comprehensive Plan. Particular emphasis shall be placed on the monitoring of the Comprehensive Plan’s adopted LOS and associated projects in the Capital Improvements Element and Program.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 39, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.2."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.4.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 40, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.2."], "text": "Assign lead departments and personnel to monitor, evaluate, and appraise applicable elements of the Comprehensive Plan to identify progress, deficiencies, and/or failures.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 41, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.3."], "text": "Policy ADM-1.4.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 42, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.3."], "text": "Update appropriate baseline data and measurable objectives at intervals appropriate to the subject area of analysis, but not less than every seven (7) years. For example, Capital Improvement data shall be maintained at semiannual and annual periods coincident with the City budget review process; population estimates should be maintained annually; and utility systems capacity shall be annually monitored.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
