", "Objective FLU-3.1."], "text": "Objective FLU-3.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 227, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1."], "text": "The City shall continue its efforts to notify stakeholders, residents, property owners and neighborhood associations of pending development reviews to provide transparency within the development process.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 228, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1.", "Policy FLU-3.1.1."], "text": "Policy FLU-3.1.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 229, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1.", "Policy FLU-3.1.1."], "text": "The Planning Department shall, when necessary, assist in the dissemination of information of applications to surrounding properties with the intent of supporting all the goals, objective and policies of the Comprehensive Plan. Specifically as it relates to ensuring residential areas are protected from potential impacts which may include noise, light, traffic, and vehicular access.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 230, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2."], "text": "Objective FLU-3.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 231, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2."], "text": "The Planning Department during its review of changes in land use and changes in zoning of properties adjoining single family neighborhoods shall continue its current efforts as provided for in the City’s Zoning Code to notify residents, property owners, neighborhood associations, organized neighborhood groups and interested parties of upcoming applications and the opportunity to provide input.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 232, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.1."], "text": "Policy FLU-3.2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 233, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.1.

", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.1."], "text": "Policy FLU-3.2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 233, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.1."], "text": "Entities requesting changes in land use and zoning for property that adjoins a single-family residential district or neighborhood shall provide ample opportunities for input into the land use process which may include one or more of the following: additional public notice via regular mail, electronic mail, establishment of website, etc; completion of neighborhood meetings; establishment of point of contact.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 234, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.2."], "text": "Policy FLU-3.2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 235, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.2."], "text": "The Planning Department, when receiving a development proposal for property that adjoins a single-family residential district, shall facilitate the contact and discussion between applicants and known organized neighborhood groups and neighborhood associations to provide the opportunity to resolve potential neighborhood issues prior to City review at public hearings. The necessity to complete further collaboration and consensus decision making to mitigate or resolve identified issues may be conducted by the City’s Planning Department or outside mediation services such as the South Florida Regional Planning Council, Institute for Community Collaboration.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 236, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3."], "text": "Objective FLU-3.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 237, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3."], "text": "The City shall encourage organized neighborhood groups, business and neighborhood associations to develop and adopt visioning and district plans and objectives that are consistent with and further the goals, objectives and policies of the Comprehensive Plan as stated herein.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
