{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 526, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.1.", "Policy COM-5.1.3."], "text": "Policy COM-5.1.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 527, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.1.", "Policy COM-5.1.3."], "text": "The City shall seek to provide adequate water distribution and hydrants for all existing and new areas annexed and serviced by the Fire Department. All existing and new water distribution systems, fire hydrants and flows shall be in compliance with the National Fire Protection Standards (NFPA) and Insurance Services Office (ISO) requirements, as amended.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 528, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.1.", "Policy COM-5.1.4."], "text": "Policy COM-5.1.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 529, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.1.", "Policy COM-5.1.4."], "text": "Water conservation practices, strategies and techniques shall be utilized to minimize the waste and unnecessary degradation of potable water sources and supplies and support the policies in the Natural Resources Element.

", "Objective COM-5.1.", "Policy COM-5.1.4."], "text": "Policy COM-5.1.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 529, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.1.", "Policy COM-5.1.4."], "text": "Water conservation practices, strategies and techniques shall be utilized to minimize the waste and unnecessary degradation of potable water sources and supplies and support the policies in the Natural Resources Element. The use of water efficient plumbing fixtures and public education in water conservation methods are to be continued by the City.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 530, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.2."], "text": "Objective COM-5.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 531, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.2."], "text": "The City of Coral Gables shall comply with its 10-year Water Supply Facilities Work Plan, as required by section 163.3177(6)(c), F.S.. The Work Plan will be updated, at a minimum, every 5 years. The City of Coral Gables Water Supply Facilities Work Plan is designed to: assess current and projected potable water demands; evaluate the sources and capacities of available water supplies; and, identify those water supply projects, using all available technologies, necessary to meet the City’s water demands for a 10-year period.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 532, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.2.", "Policy COM-5.2.1."], "text": "Policy COM-5.2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 533, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-5.", "Objective COM-5.2.", "Policy COM-5.2.1."], "text": "Comply with the 10-year Water Supply Facilities Work Plan and incorporate such work plan into the Coral Gables Comprehensive Plan.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
