{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 659, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.7.", "Policy HOU-1.7.1."], "text": "Policy HOU-1.7.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 660, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.7.", "Policy HOU-1.7.1."], "text": "The City is essentially built out and is characterized by extraordinarily high land values, significant addition to the affordable housing inventory is highly unlikely. However, the City is committed to the following directed courses of action to improve affordable housing supply on a local and region-wide basis:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 661, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.7.", "Policy HOU-1.7.1."], "text": "Pursuant to Miami-Dade County Resolution 1477-96, the City of Coral Gables is a participant on the Miami-Dade County Infill Strategy Task Force. This Task Force is directed towards identifying strategies for infill, redevelopment, and County-wide affordable housing initiatives, including regulatory, financial, and design strategies for implementation.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 662, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.7.", "Policy HOU-1.7.1."], "text": "The City of Coral Gables is working in partnership with the City of Miami to develop additional affordable housing through the City of Miami Community Development Block Grant program. This partnership has been responsible for the addition of seventeen (17) housing units to the Coral Gables affordable housing inventory.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 663, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.7.", "Policy HOU-1.7.1."], "text": "The City of Coral Gables shall continue to participate in the South Florida Regional Planning Councils affordable housing initiatives.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
