{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 810, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.4."], "text": "Support incentives that promote walking, bicycling and public transit and those that improve pedestrian and bicycle access to/and between local destinations such as public facilities, governmental facilities, schools, parks, open space, employment centers, downtown, commercial centers, high concentrations of residential, private/public schools, University of Miami and multimodal transit centers/stations.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
