{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 814, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.6."], "text": "Employ further measures to increase trolley ridership beyond the current peak day of 4,000 passengers using the trolley to provide their transportation into or out of downtown Coral Gables. Further reduce VMT on downtown streets and the number of parking spaces needed in the downtown business district by 750. By 2035, achieve a trolley ridership goal of at least 5,500 passengers daily.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
