{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 822, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.9."], "text": "The City undertook a Transportation Master Plan in 2017 that specifically identifies roadways within the City that are projected to fail the adopted LOS standards, as well as short and long term multi-modal and policy oriented mitigation measures.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
