{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 863, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.2."], "text": "FIHA roadway that is operating below any adopted LOS standard, which increase would exceed two (2%) percent of the capacity of the roadway at the adopted LOS standard, the City shall require the developer and successors to implement and maintain trip reduction measures to reduce travel by single-occupant vehicles so that the resultant increase in traffic volume does not exceed two (2%) percent.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
