{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1115, "block_type": "heading", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.1.", "Policy REC-1.1.3."], "text": "Policy REC-1.1.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1116, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.1.", "Policy REC-1.1.3."], "text": "The City shall maintain existing recreation land and facilities through the use of proper management and funding techniques.

", "Objective REC-1.1.", "Policy REC-1.1.3."], "text": "Policy REC-1.1.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1116, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.1.", "Policy REC-1.1.3."], "text": "The City shall maintain existing recreation land and facilities through the use of proper management and funding techniques. The City shall ensure that recreation facilities are well managed, well maintained, and that quality recreation opportunities are available within a 10 minute walk to all residents. This shall be partially achieved by continuing efforts toward collecting, maintaining, and updating data concerning public and private resource inventory, recreation improvements, and demand factors, and by improving design criteria and evaluation to attain a high quality park and recreation system. The City shall strive to undergo a Recreation Needs Assessment periodically to gather community input on recreation programs and facilities.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
