{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1440, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "text": "Transportation Facilities. Prior to the issuance of any development order for new development or redevelopment, public transportation facilities needed to support the development at adopted LOS standards must meet one of the following timing requirements:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
