{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1590, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "The City will actively participate and partner with the Florida Department of Transportation, the Miami-Dade MPO, the Miami-Dade Transit Authority and the South Florida Regional Planning Council to consider additional opportunities to reduce the negative impact transportation uses have on the environment.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1591, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "Policy GRN-1.3.11.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1592, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "The City will encourage and collaborate with private parking facility operators to allign pricing strategies and policies, with municipal garage rates. This initiative aims to reduce vehicle idling and congestion caused by drivers circling in search of on-street parking. By encouraging drivers to utilize oﬀ-street garages, the City seeks to decrease traﬃc congestion, improve air quality, and enhance mobility eﬃciency within its urban core. The City will identify at least three parking facilities to enter into discussions with as it relates to this policy. To encourage this policy, the City shall conduct the following:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1593, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "Engage Stakeholders: Identify and collaborate with at least three (3) private parking facilities annually to discuss pricing harmonization strategies and sustainable parking solutions.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1594, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.

", "Transportation"], "text": "Engage Stakeholders: Identify and collaborate with at least three (3) private parking facilities annually to discuss pricing harmonization strategies and sustainable parking solutions.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1594, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "Pilot Projects: Establish at least one (1) pilot program by 2035 in collaboration with a private parking operator to evaluate the eﬀectiveness of pricing parity on traﬃc patterns, air quality, and parking utilization rates.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1595, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "Incentivize Participation: Explore incentives, such as tax benefits or public recognition programs, to encourage private operators to adopt pricing strategies aligned with the City’s goals.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "block_index": 1596, "block_type": "paragraph", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Green Initiatives Element", "Goal GRN-1.", "Transportation"], "text": "By integrating value-pricing policies and harmonizing garage rates, the City reaﬃrms its commitment to sustainable transportation and reducing the environmental impact of urban mobility.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
