{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b28__c0__bc468c5d1034", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 28, "text": "Develop strategies and regulations to implement the Comprehensive Plan goals, objectives, and policies. In particular, the City’s Zoning Code should be analyzed and amended as necessary to be consistent with and promote the Comprehensive Plan goals, objectives, and policies.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b29__c0__1b85c6a7081c", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 29, "text": "Policy ADM-1.3.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b30__c0__67c6924bf308", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 30, "text": "The Planning Department shall coordinate implementation of the Comprehensive Plan goals, objectives, and policies with other City Departments.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b31__c0__d819326a9e6f", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.3.", "Policy ADM-1.3.3.

