{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b40__c0__39e3b993e30c", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Goal ADM-1.", "Objective ADM-1.1.", "Objective ADM-1.4.", "Policy ADM-1.4.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 40, "text": "Assign lead departments and personnel to monitor, evaluate, and appraise applicable elements of the Comprehensive Plan to identify progress, deficiencies, and/or failures.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
