{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b222__c0__163e08fc702d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-2.", "Objective FLU-2.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 222, "text": "Objective FLU-2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b223__c0__a9a6d15bd726", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-2.", "Objective FLU-2.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 223, "text": "The City shall develop, maintain, and implement land development regulations that serve to regulate the form, function, and interplay of land use, development, and associated activities, further the City’s Comprehensive Plan, and are consistent and compatible with County, State, and Federal plans and regulations.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b224__c0__2378a35798f7", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 224, "text": "Goal FLU-3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 3, "style": "Heading 3"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b225__c0__cd293fc819a6", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 225, "text": "The City as a part of its development review process shall engage public/community participation and collaboration to provide for a transparent development review process.

"], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 224, "text": "Goal FLU-3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 3, "style": "Heading 3"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b225__c0__cd293fc819a6", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 225, "text": "The City as a part of its development review process shall engage public/community participation and collaboration to provide for a transparent development review process.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b226__c0__3b0ea81e4bcb", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 226, "text": "Objective FLU-3.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b227__c0__36cbbbd49315", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 227, "text": "The City shall continue its efforts to notify stakeholders, residents, property owners and neighborhood associations of pending development reviews to provide transparency within the development process.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b228__c0__8eb393bcb962", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1.", "Policy FLU-3.1.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 228, "text": "Policy FLU-3.1.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b229__c0__168f0c2491c0", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.1.", "Policy FLU-3.1.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 229, "text": "The Planning Department shall, when necessary, assist in the dissemination of information of applications to surrounding properties with the intent of supporting all the goals, objective and policies of the Comprehensive Plan. Specifically as it relates to ensuring residential areas are protected from potential impacts which may include noise, light, traffic, and vehicular access.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b230__c0__1c453c59fcf5", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 230, "text": "Objective FLU-3.2.

Specifically as it relates to ensuring residential areas are protected from potential impacts which may include noise, light, traffic, and vehicular access.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b230__c0__1c453c59fcf5", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 230, "text": "Objective FLU-3.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b231__c0__4633bf52ff56", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 231, "text": "The Planning Department during its review of changes in land use and changes in zoning of properties adjoining single family neighborhoods shall continue its current efforts as provided for in the City’s Zoning Code to notify residents, property owners, neighborhood associations, organized neighborhood groups and interested parties of upcoming applications and the opportunity to provide input.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b232__c0__42702a6901b0", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 232, "text": "Policy FLU-3.2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b233__c0__61122b748875", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 233, "text": "Entities requesting changes in land use and zoning for property that adjoins a single-family residential district or neighborhood shall provide ample opportunities for input into the land use process which may include one or more of the following: additional public notice via regular mail, electronic mail, establishment of website, etc; completion of neighborhood meetings; establishment of point of contact.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b234__c0__7f1c39597d11", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 234, "text": "Policy FLU-3.2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b235__c0__e146740fd00d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.

", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 234, "text": "Policy FLU-3.2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b235__c0__e146740fd00d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.2.", "Policy FLU-3.2.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 235, "text": "The Planning Department, when receiving a development proposal for property that adjoins a single-family residential district, shall facilitate the contact and discussion between applicants and known organized neighborhood groups and neighborhood associations to provide the opportunity to resolve potential neighborhood issues prior to City review at public hearings. The necessity to complete further collaboration and consensus decision making to mitigate or resolve identified issues may be conducted by the City’s Planning Department or outside mediation services such as the South Florida Regional Planning Council, Institute for Community Collaboration.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b236__c0__26a4a888a35d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 236, "text": "Objective FLU-3.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b237__c0__606421b65b86", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 237, "text": "The City shall encourage organized neighborhood groups, business and neighborhood associations to develop and adopt visioning and district plans and objectives that are consistent with and further the goals, objectives and policies of the Comprehensive Plan as stated herein.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b238__c0__af252ac5f2a1", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3.", "Policy FLU-3.3.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 238, "text": "Policy FLU-3.3.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b239__c0__1ed767f4317c", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3.", "Policy FLU-3.3.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 239, "text": "The Planning Department shall keep on file contact information and visioning and district plans and objectives provided by organized neighborhood groups, business and neighborhood associations, which shall be made available to the public and applicants of development proposals that adjoin single-family neighborhoods.

", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b239__c0__1ed767f4317c", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3.", "Policy FLU-3.3.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 239, "text": "The Planning Department shall keep on file contact information and visioning and district plans and objectives provided by organized neighborhood groups, business and neighborhood associations, which shall be made available to the public and applicants of development proposals that adjoin single-family neighborhoods.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b240__c0__b9b722640607", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3.", "Policy FLU-3.3.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 240, "text": "Policy FLU-3.3.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b241__c0__c0cc880adf22", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.3.", "Policy FLU-3.3.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 241, "text": "As can practically be accommodated in conformance with the City’s land development regulations, the City will assist neighborhood groups, business and neighborhood associations who have developed neighborhood plans in minimizing potential impacts between non-residential and residential land uses, with the intent of ensuring residential areas are protected from potential impacts which may include noise, light, traffic, and vehicular access.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b242__c0__4c0f7f11092f", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.4."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 242, "text": "Objective FLU-3.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b243__c0__1db0817c6f8f", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Future Land Use Element", "Goal FLU-3.", "Objective FLU-3.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 243, "text": "When the need arises to provide a collaborative process, consensus building and/or mediation for City identified issues, development projects, etc., the City shall initiate processes to build and facilitate partnerships with institutions, private practitioners, stakeholders, property owners, neighborhoods and organizations to fulfill the City’s obligation for secure community involvement. This could include use of internal City resources or outside facilitators such as the South Florida Regional Planning Council, Institute for Community Collaboration.

", "Objective FLU-3.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 243, "text": "When the need arises to provide a collaborative process, consensus building and/or mediation for City identified issues, development projects, etc., the City shall initiate processes to build and facilitate partnerships with institutions, private practitioners, stakeholders, property owners, neighborhoods and organizations to fulfill the City’s obligation for secure community involvement. This could include use of internal City resources or outside facilitators such as the South Florida Regional Planning Council, Institute for Community Collaboration.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
