{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b344__c0__0f17e0eaa7b9", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Governance Element", "Goal GOV-3.", "Objective GOV-3.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 344, "text": "The comprehensive planning process is continuous and dynamic in nature. Maintaining the effectiveness of the plan requires its periodic review. This program, required under Section 163, F.S. , as amended, provides orderly procedures for monitoring, updating and evaluation of the plan and attendant Evaluation and Appraisal Report (EAR) (163.3191, F.S., as amended). For the purpose of monitoring, evaluating and appraising the implementation of the Comprehensive Plan, a five-year program for monitoring, updating and evaluation shall be followed. More detailed procedures shall be adopted by the City to direct the ongoing activity.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
