{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b490__c0__dd4703b9892d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Community Facilities Element", "Goal COM-3.", "Objective COM-3.1.", "Policy COM-3.1.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 490, "text": "The City shall cooperate in the hazardous waste collection and disposal programs of Miami- Dade County by enforcing within the City's jurisdiction hazardous waste collection practices required by the county and other agencies with jurisdiction. The City shall coordinate with Miami-Dade County DERM in preparation and maintenance of an up-to-date list of all businesses in the City that store, use and/or dispose of hazardous and toxic materials and/or waste.

", "Objective COM-3.1.", "Policy COM-3.1.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 490, "text": "The City shall cooperate in the hazardous waste collection and disposal programs of Miami- Dade County by enforcing within the City's jurisdiction hazardous waste collection practices required by the county and other agencies with jurisdiction. The City shall coordinate with Miami-Dade County DERM in preparation and maintenance of an up-to-date list of all businesses in the City that store, use and/or dispose of hazardous and toxic materials and/or waste.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
