{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b567__c0__9f8f2fc07d86", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.1.", "Policy HOU-1.1.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 567, "text": "Policy HOU-1.1.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b568__c0__6005700b6704", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.1.", "Policy HOU-1.1.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 568, "text": "The utilization of federal, state, and local housing subsidy programs is recognized as a means to provide affordable/attainable housing opportunities for low income persons and families, where appropriate.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b569__c0__c21e9c6aa667", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.1.", "Policy HOU-1.1.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 569, "text": "Policy HOU-1.1.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b570__c0__79043639515e", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.1.", "Policy HOU-1.1.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 570, "text": "In calculating Coral Gables' affordable housing needs, the City shall use the median household income figure for Coral Gables, to calculate its affordable/attainable housing need, not Miami-Dade County. The median household income shall be obtained from the most recent data available.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b571__c0__c4d6e7823b91", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.1.", "Policy HOU-1.1.4."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 571, "text": "Policy HOU-1.1.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b572__c0__2ac6bb6c55d3", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.

