{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b572__c0__2ac6bb6c55d3", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.1.", "Policy HOU-1.1.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 572, "text": "By 2035, the City shall continue to provide for affordable/attainable housing programs to address the City’s fair share of regional affordable housing needs. This may include partnerships between the City and other local governments, affordable housing agencies, etc. The City shall examine a multi-pronged approach to address the City’s fair share of affordable housing which may include the following:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
