{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b648__c0__e39445542772", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Housing Element", "Goal HOU-1.", "Objective HOU-1.5.", "Policy HOU-1.5.8."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 648, "text": "The City shall continue to promote diversity in housing types by providing land use designations and zoning districts on the Future Land Use Map and the Official Zoning Map, respectively, to ensure that single-family, duplex, multi-family housing units, and mixed use development are allowed within the City.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
