{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b811__c0__b76cec50eaf3", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.5."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 811, "text": "Policy MOB-1.1.5.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b812__c0__99471872ce65", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.5."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 812, "text": "Improve amenities within public spaces, streets, alleys and parks to include the following improvements: seating; art; architectural elements (at street level); lighting; bicycle parking; street trees; improved pedestrian crossing with bulbouts, small curb radii, on-street parking along sidewalks, pedestrian paths and bicycle paths to encourage walking and cycling with the intent of enhancing the feeling of safety.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b813__c0__af11fcc65d97", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.6."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 813, "text": "Policy MOB-1.1.6.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b814__c0__b99cdba1e2d0", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.6."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 814, "text": "Employ further measures to increase trolley ridership beyond the current peak day of 4,000 passengers using the trolley to provide their transportation into or out of downtown Coral Gables.

", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b814__c0__b99cdba1e2d0", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.6."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 814, "text": "Employ further measures to increase trolley ridership beyond the current peak day of 4,000 passengers using the trolley to provide their transportation into or out of downtown Coral Gables. Further reduce VMT on downtown streets and the number of parking spaces needed in the downtown business district by 750. By 2035, achieve a trolley ridership goal of at least 5,500 passengers daily.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b815__c0__1bd467d484e2", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.6."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 815, "text": "(Ord. No. 2025-14, 06/10/25)", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b816__c0__49897c0761f6", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.7."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 816, "text": "Policy MOB-1.1.7.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b817__c0__65d9ca51d73a", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-1.", "Objective MOB-1.1.", "Policy MOB-1.1.7."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 817, "text": "Continue to expand the current trolley system by 2035 to meet the needs of the community with specific attention to a northern expansion of the system and connection to the University of Miami.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
