{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b864__c0__a443a9302fa7", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 864, "text": "Policy MOB-2.2.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b865__c0__d21378991060", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 865, "text": "The City will maintain and update, as required in its Concurrency Management Program (CMP) or administrative rules, appropriate criteria and methodologies to implement the exception authorized in this policy consistent with requirements of Chapter 163, F.S., as amended.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b866__c0__d537c81b83b4", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.4."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 866, "text": "Policy MOB-2.2.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b867__c0__f2b1f42de070", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 867, "text": "A proposed development, that conforms to the criteria enumerated in Section 163.3180(6), F.S., as amended and is located in any portion of the Gables Redevelopment and Infill District (GRID) where an affected transportation facility is operating below its adopted LOS standard, is deemed to have a de minimis impact that, alone or in combination with other similar or lesser impacts, will not cause unacceptable degradation of the level of service on affected transportation facilities. The City will maintain and update as required in its Concurrency Management Program or administrative rules appropriate methodologies for determining and monitoring de minimis impacts consistent with Section 163.3180(6), F.S., as amended, and Chapter 9J-5, Florida Administrative Code, as amended.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b868__c0__890815f9c4ec", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.5."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 868, "text": "Policy MOB-2.2.5.

", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b868__c0__890815f9c4ec", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.5."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 868, "text": "Policy MOB-2.2.5.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b869__c0__7f5744ecac7d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Mobility Element", "Goal MOB-2.", "Objective MOB-2.2.", "Policy MOB-2.2.5."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 869, "text": "As a vibrant mature City located in rapidly growing Miami-Dade County, the City shall continue to pursue and promote infill and redevelopment in appropriate parts of the City, especially within the City’s GRID. The City shall research the following:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
