", "Objective NAT-1.2.", "Policy NAT-1.2.13."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1001, "text": "Policy NAT-1.2.13.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1002__c0__07832c66e240", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-1.", "Objective NAT-1.2.", "Policy NAT-1.2.13."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1002, "text": "The City will participate, when warranted, in the SFWMD’s Water Savings Incentive Program (Water SIP) for large-scale retrofits as recommended by the Lower East Coast Water Supply Plan.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1003__c0__78c5b6ec3070", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-1.", "Objective NAT-1.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1003, "text": "Objective NAT-1.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
