", "Objective NAT-1.7."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1045, "text": "Objective NAT-1.7.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1046__c0__65e18c626314", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-1.", "Objective NAT-1.7."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1046, "text": "The City shall conserve, appropriately use, and protect minerals, soils and native vegetative communities. Assure the maintenance and conservation of trees within the City through continued maintenance of trees on all properties and the site plan development review process.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1047__c0__4564adc463b3", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-1.", "Objective NAT-1.7.", "Policy NAT-1.7.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1047, "text": "Policy NAT-1.7.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1048__c0__11800230db92", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-1.", "Objective NAT-1.7.", "Policy NAT-1.7.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1048, "text": "Ensure the preservation of trees during development or redevelopment wherever possible, and consistent with the tree preservation ordinance and landscape ordinance. Where trees approved for removal as a last resort, require that they be replaced with quality trees of equal or greater canopy.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1049__c0__f762b51b896f", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1049, "text": "Goal NAT-2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 3, "style": "Heading 3"}}
