{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1066__c0__cba96f02efb2", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2.", "Objective NAT-2.2.", "Policy NAT-2.2.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1066, "text": "Coordinate with appropriate public agencies for the management of the coastal zone to provide a balance between irreversible commitments and conservation of resources.

"], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1065, "text": "Policy NAT-2.2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1066__c0__cba96f02efb2", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2.", "Objective NAT-2.2.", "Policy NAT-2.2.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1066, "text": "Coordinate with appropriate public agencies for the management of the coastal zone to provide a balance between irreversible commitments and conservation of resources. Methods for coordinating with Miami-Dade County and neighboring local governments to prevent estuarine pollution and protection of Biscayne Bay, control surface water runoff, and protect living marine resources shall be identified and set forth in interlocal agreements or other methodologies.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1067__c0__b20b998caafa", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2.", "Objective NAT-2.2.", "Policy NAT-2.2.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1067, "text": "Policy NAT-2.2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1068__c0__2a7b94b91ca2", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2.", "Objective NAT-2.2.", "Policy NAT-2.2.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1068, "text": "Review and incorporate appropriate changes to the City’s Natural Resources Element for natural resource protection consistent with management plans by Miami-Dade County, and state and federal agencies.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1069__c0__4ff6a4b86a98", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2.", "Objective NAT-2.2.", "Policy NAT-2.2.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1069, "text": "Policy NAT-2.2.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1070__c0__432cead71361", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Natural Resources Element", "Goal NAT-2.", "Objective NAT-2.2.", "Policy NAT-2.2.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1070, "text": "Land use planning and management of development regulations in the coastal zone shall be based on sound ecological principles and the public benefit.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
