{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1131__c0__07ae43179a74", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.1.", "Policy REC-1.1.10."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1131, "text": "The City shall update the Parks and Open Space Master Plan by 2036 which will consist of a comprehensive needs assessment; an analytical analysis based on existing data and standards; a detailed action plan and funding strategies to implement the vision. The Master Plan will focus on the feasibility of the following: creating more neighborhood parks; more family focused activities; additional trails; fitness centers; outdoor activities ; educational programs and outdoor fitness programs.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
