{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1175__c0__7314c2acc7a0", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.5."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1175, "text": "Will it further the City’s goals of maintaining the adopted LOS standards for recreation and open space?", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1176__c0__a851cfe5e81d", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.5."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1176, "text": "Will it further the City’s goals to maintain a high quality of life and provide a high quality of recreational opportunities for the City’s residents and visitors?", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1177__c0__35167e851677", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.6."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1177, "text": "Policy REC-1.4.6.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1178__c0__e9d61a6abef6", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.6."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1178, "text": "The Community Recreation Department shall continue efforts to further private-public partnerships and sponsorships through approved policies and procedures in order to provide additional financial and in kind support of City parks, facilities and programs.

", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1178__c0__e9d61a6abef6", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.6."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1178, "text": "The Community Recreation Department shall continue efforts to further private-public partnerships and sponsorships through approved policies and procedures in order to provide additional financial and in kind support of City parks, facilities and programs.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1179__c0__f8cfbbcc431f", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.7."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1179, "text": "Policy REC-1.4.7.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1180__c0__201f992b99c1", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.7."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1180, "text": "The Community Recreation Department shall continue to work towards the vision and goals as set forth in the 2021 Coral Gables Community Recreation Master Plan referenced as an Appendix. The Vision sub-systems of Parks and Facilities, Recreation Programing and Community Health, Access and Linkages, Cultural and Historic Resources and Sustainability and Resilience will be the goal areas that will be the focus of future efforts. The Department will concentrate on specific guiding principles: Continued Enhancement of existing facilities, greater variety of activities, development of additional parks, facilities and open spaces, improved level of access to all parks and facilities, additional health and wellness facilities and programming, development of waterway and blueway access, integration of art and cultural features in parks, facilities and programming, and creation of a resilient and sustainable park system.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1181__c0__8d51a29d7d12", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.8."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1181, "text": "Policy REC-1.4.8.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1182__c0__a3b7b76ea0d3", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.8."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1182, "text": "The City shall integrate historic preservation into its recreational framework by protecting and promoting designated historic sites within parks and recreational areas.

", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1182__c0__a3b7b76ea0d3", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.8."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1182, "text": "The City shall integrate historic preservation into its recreational framework by protecting and promoting designated historic sites within parks and recreational areas. This integration will enhance public engagement with cultural heritage, provide educational opportunities, and ensure long-term site protection. The City will periodically conduct a Recreation Needs Assessment to gather community input on recreation programs and facilities, including the incorporation of historic sites and structures.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1183__c0__1bd467d484e2", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Recreation and Open Space Element", "Goal REC-1.", "Objective REC-1.4.", "Policy REC-1.4.8."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1183, "text": "(Ord. No. 2025-14, 06/10/25)", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1184__c0__1755f70ebe66", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Historical Resources Element"], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1184, "text": "Historical Resources Element", "extra": {"heading_level": 2, "style": "Heading 2"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1185__c0__acc09a37b4c9", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Historical Resources Element"], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1185, "text": "Vision Statement: Provide the comprehensive plan foundation for the protection and enhancement of the City of Coral Gables’ historic and cultural resources, including buildings, structures, sites, districts, objects, archaeological sites, and other landmarks.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1186__c0__d72e85ec87dc", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Historical Resources Element"], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1186, "text": "Goals, Objectives and Policies:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
