{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1309__c0__0024c0c87012", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.1.", "Policy SAF-2.1.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1309, "text": "Policy SAF-2.1.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1310__c0__586a9827d284", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.1.", "Policy SAF-2.1.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1310, "text": "The City shall abide by the Coastal High Hazard Area (CHHA) defined as the area below the elevation of the category 1 storm surge line as established by a Sea, Lake, and Overland Surges from Hurricanes (SLOSH) computerized storm surge model (see SAF-1: Storm Tide Atlas Map).", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1311__c0__7ab405f3e482", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.1.", "Policy SAF-2.1.4."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1311, "text": "Policy SAF-2.1.4.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1312__c0__340530c6d69e", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.1.", "Policy SAF-2.1.4."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1312, "text": "The Coastal Area within the City of Coral Gables shall be defined as the land south of the Coral Gables Waterway, east of Old Cutler Road, and north of the southern limit of the City.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1313__c0__df0fb91ea184", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1313, "text": "Objective SAF-2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1314__c0__dc81da24ba42", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.

", "Objective SAF-2.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1313, "text": "Objective SAF-2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1314__c0__dc81da24ba42", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1314, "text": "Assure that future development or redevelopment maintains or reduces hurricane evacuation times. The City establishes an out-of-county hurricane evacuation time for a category 5 hurricane of 16 hours. Mitigation is permitted to achieve and maintain these standards.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1315__c0__1042b0dc8c1b", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.2.", "Policy SAF-2.2.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1315, "text": "Policy SAF-2.2.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1316__c0__799d2278b616", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.2.", "Policy SAF-2.2.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1316, "text": "Manage the location of population concentration by maintaining lowdensity residential land use designations in the CHHA by directing higherdensity population concentrations to areas away from the CHHA through the City's land use planning process.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1317__c0__55a84ef49149", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.2.", "Policy SAF-2.2.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1317, "text": "Policy SAF-2.2.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1318__c0__e24af5817dff", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.2.", "Policy SAF-2.2.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1318, "text": "Monitor hurricane and emergency management studies with the intent of identifying and correcting deficiencies. Continue to integrate regional and local notification and evacuation procedures into the City’s Emergency Operations Plan.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
