", "Objective SAF-2.2.", "Policy SAF-2.2.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1318, "text": "Monitor hurricane and emergency management studies with the intent of identifying and correcting deficiencies. Continue to integrate regional and local notification and evacuation procedures into the City’s Emergency Operations Plan.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1319__c0__59a875664428", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1319, "text": "Objective SAF-2.3.", "extra": {"heading_level": 4, "style": "Heading 4"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1320__c0__b8e1d5bd7579", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1320, "text": "Establish priorities and development guidelines for postdisaster redevelopment in the coastal area.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1321__c0__8e01a6660eda", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3.", "Policy SAF-2.3.1."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1321, "text": "Policy SAF-2.3.1.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1322__c0__8c5b199b3be7", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3.", "Policy SAF-2.3.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1322, "text": "Update the Post Disaster Development Plan annually. The plan shall address land use, public safety, infrastructure, and public investment concerns. The plan shall include policies to distinguish between immediate repair and cleanup actions needed to protect public health and safety and longterm repair and redevelopment activities; and the removal, relocation, or structural modification of damaged infrastructure and unsafe structures. The plan should also ensure all redevelopment shall reduce or eliminate the exposure of human life and public and private property to natural hazards.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1323__c0__9d21b7f7f461", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3.", "Policy SAF-2.3.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1323, "text": "Policy SAF-2.3.2.

The plan should also ensure all redevelopment shall reduce or eliminate the exposure of human life and public and private property to natural hazards.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1323__c0__9d21b7f7f461", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3.", "Policy SAF-2.3.2."], "block_type": "heading", "block_index": 1323, "text": "Policy SAF-2.3.2.", "extra": {"heading_level": 5, "style": "Heading 5"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1324__c0__eb2731399739", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Public Safety Element", "Goal SAF-2.", "Objective SAF-2.3.", "Policy SAF-2.3.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1324, "text": "Annually incorporate recommendations of interagency hazard mitigation into the Comprehensive Plan and PostDisaster Redevelopment Plan. The redevelopment plan shall identify areas which may warrant postdisaster redevelopment, including elimination of unsafe conditions and inappropriate land uses, and limitation of redevelopment in areas of likely repeated damage.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
