{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1365__c0__3b1c97d75a55", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.1."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1365, "text": "Maintain and enhance public facilities and delivery of services for both existing and future residents and property owners. The City shall allocate resources for the necessary provision, repair, replacement, and/or upgrading facilities and services necessary to maintain locally adopted level of service (LOS) standards.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
