{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1425__c0__69d63ff6468a", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1425, "text": "All threshold development shall be contingent upon the provision of the necessary services at adopted levels and on a timely basis. Threshold development shall mean any development that increases gross floor area or increases demand for public facilities or services.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
