{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1440__c0__0d2baa94ae6e", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1440, "text": "Transportation Facilities. Prior to the issuance of any development order for new development or redevelopment, public transportation facilities needed to support the development at adopted LOS standards must meet one of the following timing requirements:", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1441__c0__5ec7524a7a3e", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1441, "text": "The necessary facilities and services are in place or under construction; or", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1442__c0__e31d102c1951", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1442, "text": "A development order or permit is issued subject to the conditions that the necessary facilities and services needed to serve the new development are scheduled to be in place or under actual construction not more than three years after issuance of a certificate of occupancy or its functional equivalent as provided in the City’s adopted 5-Year Schedule of Capital Improvements or transportation projects included in the first three years of the applicable, adopted Florida Department of Transportation Five Year Work Program and Miami-Dade County’s 5-Year Transportation Improvement Program.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1443__c0__5e0c6991f0c1", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3.

", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1443__c0__5e0c6991f0c1", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1443, "text": "The estimated date of commencement of actual construction and the estimated date of project completion must be included.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1444__c0__6d437805337a", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1444, "text": "The necessary facilities and services are the subject of a binding executed agreement which requires the necessary facilities and services to serve the new development to be in place or under actual construction within three years after the City approves a building permit or its functional equivalent that results in traffic generation; or", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1445__c0__d57853a14508", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1445, "text": "The necessary facilities and services are guaranteed in an enforceable development agreement, pursuant to Section 163.3180(1) (c) F.S. or an agreement or development order issued pursuant to Chapter 380, F.S. to be in place or under actual construction within three years after the City approves a building permit or its functional equivalent that results in traffic generation.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1446__c0__ef6250be0dbf", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-1.", "Objective CIE-1.3.", "Policy CIE-1.3.3."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1446, "text": "Educational Facilities. Public school facility capacity improvements programmed in the first three years of the Miami-Dade County Public Schools Facilities Work Program shall be counted as available capacity for purposes of concurrency. The necessary public school facilities must be in place or under actual construction within three years after issuance of final site plan approval.", "extra": {"style": "Body Text"}}
