{"id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan__b1493__c0__f39ac278d5fd", "doc_id": "Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan", "source_path": "/workspaces/civicai-mvp/data/raw/Coral_Gables_Comprehensive_Plan.docx", "section_path": ["Administration Element", "Capital Improvements Element", "Goal CIE-5.", "Objective CIE-5.1.", "Policy CIE-5.1.2."], "block_type": "paragraph", "block_index": 1493, "text": "Appropriate mechanisms will be developed and adopted consistent with the South Florida Water Management District and Miami-Dade County in order to assure that adequate water supplies are available to all water users and to ensure that adequate water supply is available prior to approval of a building permit. Furthermore, the City of Coral Gables will be responsible for providing monthly building permit data to MDWASD to be used for monitoring the availability of water supplies for all water users of the Miami-Dade County Water and Sewer Department within the City limits, and for implementing a system that links water supplies to the permitting of new development.

